  prove this VPS is reachable from the public internet (that
  depends on upstream routing/provider firewall/NAT, none of which
  this script can see from inside the host), and it does NOT prove
  a real VLESS+REALITY or Hysteria2 client can complete a full
  handshake end-to-end. See 'vpn-admin doctor --protocol' for a
  best-effort loopback self-test, deploy/almalinux/acceptance-test.sh
  for the listener/access-matrix checks, and
  docs/DEVICE_ACCEPTANCE_TESTS.md for what real-client verification
  requires and whether it has actually been performed.
